Even though, learned Tribunal had considered the addition on the count of 'future prospects' to be 50%, but however, as per Pranay Sethi's case, considering the age of the deceased to be 29 years,
while taking date of birth of Rashmi Gundappa as 10.12.1981, as evident from various educational certificates, coming forth and considering the employment document of the deceased, the addition,
ought to be made, to the extent of 40%, which is to the extent of Rs.3,44,632/-.
